  "summary_html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\">\n\n\n\n\n</div><div style=\"border-left:1px blue solid; border-bottom:1px blue solid; border-right:1px blue solid; border-radius:0 0 4px 4px; height:4px; background-color:#fff7f7; margin:0 0 16px 0;\"></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table> \n\n\n\n\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Wisps</b> are a hivemind race of inter-dimensional information brokers who manifest on various worlds as sparkling balls of blue light. They appear in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Ultima_IV:_Quest_of_the_Avatar\" title=\"Ultima IV: Quest of the Avatar\">Ultima&#160;IV</a></i>, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Ultima_V:_Warriors_of_Destiny\" title=\"Ultima V: Warriors of Destiny\">Ultima&#160;V</a></i>, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Ultima_VI:_The_False_Prophet\" title=\"Ultima VI: The False Prophet\">Ultima&#160;VI</a></i>, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Ultima_VII:_The_Black_Gate\" title=\"Ultima VII: The Black Gate\">Ultima&#160;VII</a></i>, as well as in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Ultima_Underworld:_The_Stygian_Abyss\" title=\"Ultima Underworld: The Stygian Abyss\">Ultima Underworld</a></i>, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Ultima_Underworld_II:_Labyrinth_of_Worlds\" title=\"Ultima Underworld II: Labyrinth of Worlds\">Ultima Underworld&#160;II</a></i>, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Savage_Empire\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Savage Empire\">Savage Empire</a></i> and <i><a href=\"/wiki/Martian_Dreams\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Martian Dreams\">Martian Dreams</a></i>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">",
